    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31215" root="عيش" body-key="E">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعاشهُ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (God, S, A) <i>made him to live;</i>
(S, A, O, * K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عيّشهُ</span></b> , (O, * K,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْيِيشٌ</span>. (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعاشهُ ٱللّٰهُ عِيشَةً رَاضِيَةٌ</span>
[<i>God made him to live a pleasant life,</i> or <i>state</i> or
<i>sort of life</i>]. (S.)

